Subject: Re: ev4sched---here it is

ev4sched uses a quadratic algorithm to schedule blocks.  It's accurate, but
slow.  A colleague here at the university has an Alpha scheduler that is
almost as accurate as ev4sched and as fast as the scheduler the DEC cc uses
(this is from memory, but the numbers he had looked very good).  I don't
think that code is production quality, but if somebody wanted it, I'm sure
it could be had.

