True - we're trying to fix this. The answer for what you wanted to do it:

	1) rpm -i apache*src.rpm
	2) rpm -bp /usr/src/redhat/apache*.spec
	3) cd /usr/src/redhat/BUILD/apache*
	4) do the rest by hand

